WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.251
The overview brings together tasks and warnings.

00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.931
Check which building each item belongs to before taking action.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.624
Choose the active building at the top.

00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:14.698
Administration reloads its data. Check the building name before making changes.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.568
Building and Equipment separates locations from equipment.

00:00:18.568 --> 00:00:23.769
Deactivating a building is not routine cleanup. Check the consequences first.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.333
Apartment membership and administration permissions are different things.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:33.047
An additional QR card creates a resident sign-in, not administrator rights.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.543
A trusted deputy protects against losing administrative access.

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:42.582
Check the person and permissions carefully. Handover does not mean sharing a password.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.821
A backup needs a tested recovery path.

00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:52.218
Use only approved download and protected storage. External backup integrations are blocked in production.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:56.808
Maintenance is planned operational work, not an everyday switch.

00:00:56.808 --> 00:01:03.379
It requires backup, authorization and checks afterwards. This recording does not start maintenance.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.761
The global pilot reset is blocked in production.

00:01:06.761 --> 00:01:11.567
Do not use it for cleanup. Data removal needs a separately reviewed task.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.111
System shows service and operational status.

00:01:15.111 --> 00:01:20.789
The audit records administrative actions. Do not silently remove technical records.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:25.391
Before a major action, check the building, target and recovery path.

00:01:25.391 --> 00:01:29.106
Finish deliberately. Sign out on shared devices.
